  "privacyPolicyHeaderSubtitle": "Privacy Policy (100% Local-First)",
  "privacyPolicyIntro": "Effective Date: August 20, 2026\nEKER Studio built the Balance app as an ad-free, privacy-first personal health tracking utility.",
  "privacyPolicySection1Body": "• Personal & Health Data: All metrics (weight entries, height, BMI calculations, target goals, calendar logs) are stored EXCLUSIVELY LOCALLY on your device. We do not operate external servers collecting health data.\n• Biometric Security: If biometric lock is enabled (Fingerprint/FaceID), authentication is handled entirely by your device operating system.",
  "privacyPolicySection1Title": "1. Local-First & Zero Account Model",
  "privacyPolicySection2Body": "• Balance connects with Google Health Connect only after explicit user permission.\n• Data is used strictly to display metrics within the app.\n• We never sell or share Health Connect data with third parties, advertisers, or data brokers.",
  "privacyPolicySection2Title": "2. Google Health Connect Integration",
  "privacyPolicySection3Body": "• Crash Diagnostics: The app may collect anonymous technical crash logs via Firebase Crashlytics to diagnose defects and improve stability.\n• Usage Telemetry: Anonymous interaction events (such as button clicks and screen views) may be logged via Firebase Analytics to improve user experience.\n• Zero Health Data Shared: Crash reports and telemetry events NEVER contain personal health measurements (weight, height, BMI, goal values) or identifiable sensitive data.",
  "privacyPolicySection3Title": "3. Diagnostics & Telemetry (No Health Data)",
  "privacyPolicySection4Body": "• We do not sell, trade, rent, or share personal data with third parties.\n• All backups (e.g. CSV exports) are generated locally under your full control.",
  "privacyPolicySection4Title": "4. Third-Party Access & Sharing",
  "privacyPolicySection5Body": "• Balance is intended for personal tracking and informational purposes only. It is not a medical device and does not diagnose or treat any medical condition.",
  "privacyPolicySection5Title": "5. Medical Disclaimer",
  "privacyPolicySection6Body": "• Our app is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children.",
  "privacyPolicySection6Title": "6. Children's Privacy",
  "privacyPolicySection7Body": "If you have any questions or suggestions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us:",
  "privacyPolicySection7Title": "7. Contact Us",
